The bare pool is solving the smaller rungs by recognizing the inverse immediately: easy was 3/3 solved, and medium has at least one verified solution already. That is expected behavior for a Track B ladder; the harness is escalating automatically toward larger fields and longer compositions while the witness stays fixed at eight vectors.
