+        "becomes a lexicographic candidate scan with complexity O(m*p^2*L); at "
+        "the hard preset p=499, m=8, L=5 a profiling run measured an eight-seed "
+        "mean of 1,011,574 candidate tests, 24,277,767 counted finite-field "
