A second `p=2027` instance was solved. At this point a held result, if any, will have to come from larger-number exactness at eight layers rather than discovery of the structural route. That distinction will be stated explicitly in the caveats.
diff --git a/gen_2306_03595.py b/gen_2306_03595.py
