The final shipping gate report is now complete and consistent with the hardened preset. One important caveat emerged and will be prominent in the README: because the structural hint scored 0/3 while placebo scored 1/3, the held level appears to stress reliable execution of the inverse over large residues more than discovery of the bijection insight. It remains within the formal 288-operation cap, but that interpretive limitation should not be hidden.
