+| 2: `p=499,L=5,m=8` | 1102985696 | GPT-5.6 Terra | solved (`ok`) |
+| 2 | 1983721903 | Gemini 3.8 Flash | solved (`ok`) |
+| 2 | 1330875117 | Gemini 3.8 Flash | solved (`ok`) |
+| 3: `p=1009,L=6,m=8` | 384453063 | GPT-5.6 Terra | solved (`ok`) |
