Completed a self-contained Track B generator based on the paper’s Section 1.7 transversal definition and Lemma 3.1 partial-embedding framework ([paper](https://arxiv.org/html/2306.03595)).

Key results:

- Shipping preset: `p=8117`, 8 matching edges, 8 affine layers.
- All G1–G9 gates pass.
- Structure-aware guessing: 0/200,000.
- Four adversarial attacks: each 0/8.
- Bare oracle: 0/3 solved at shipping after all lower levels were solved.
- G9: hinted 0/3, placebo 1/3.
- Answer: 97 characters, 16 atoms.
- Intended route: 288 exact operations.
- Track B reference inverse: 8/8 solved.
- Mechanical scan: approximately 246.5M candidates and 8.87B field operations.

